451735 learned scalars, 512 Adam updates; selected epoch 20, validation AP50 0.127463. Test: 23 digits in eight scenes, inclusive VOC AP50 0.063752, COCO AP75 0.002704, AP50:95 0.017808, 718 detections. Selected mean absolute first BN state 1.111025; paired learned and BN state restored.
